manifests and SDK release identity identify the retained component inputs and
MapleSU changes. Component notices accompany their respective sources.

libsu service modifications retain Apache-2.0 terms and the upstream trampoline.
Magisk-derived policy code retains GPL notices; libsepol retains LGPL notices.
The independent Zygisk adapter and its ReZygisk dependencies are maintained and
distributed through the module repository. They are not included in this source
distribution or built into the MapleSU Manager. Their notices and release review
